  "correction": "Confirmed: the existential chart conclusion of the old local-diffeomorphism supplier does not imply null preservation in prescribed A/B charts. The new argument fixes those charts, applies the C1 local Lipschitz supplier to the identity with singleton compact set, shrinks to a cube in its coordinate neighbourhood, and extends by the explicit coordinate clamp. The global Lipschitz null-image theorem now gives precisely psi(E intersection W). Countable choice is spent only on countable cover witnesses and cube-cover sequences. Zero dimension is treated by emptiness, and swapping the atlases proves the full equivalence. Focused ordinary local repair only; no new audit, judge, initial publication or native adjudication coverage. The actual scoped dependency level is also corrected from 2 to 1 after the newly installed supplier dependencies.",
